	| Product Name          | DXP Production      |

Scenario: Remove complimentary from a new DXP license and view on customer
	Testing the ability to remove complimentary from a new license from provisioning and view on customer

	Given I publish a project with no partner RabbitMQ message with routing key "dossiera.provisioning.create" with the following values
	| Account Name                           | Cstpro - ${staticCompanyName}              |
	| Address City                           | Diamond Bar                                |
	| Address Country                        | United States                              |
	| Address Postal Code                    | 91765                                      |
